# to update this file, run
# bazel run fix //:\*
# NB: MacOS
# if you run the above ↑ on MacOS
# it will almost certainly break in CI
# due to the conditional package 'appnope'
# that is not needed on Linux, but IS needed
# on MacOS.
#
# I don't have a good solution to this yet,
# but I've wasted enough time trying to diagnose the issue
# that this note has become justified!
# Keep direct dependencies at least as new as the versions we support.
# Without floors, a resolver can satisfy newer transitive dependencies by
# silently selecting an obsolete release with fewer dependency constraints.
